[{"client_msg_id":"f7ef7180-3927-4833-ba22-58fbbe594922","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そして見直したらまた昼の部なくなってた","ts":"1625835304.049400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WCC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5def098-1def-4a1d-a340-49d175cf351b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"昼の部(14:00)が売り切れてたので夜の部(18:00)を買ったのだけど、今見たらチケットが復活しててつらい。いやまあ夜でもいいんだけど。選べるなら昼に行きたかった","ts":"1625835272.049100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q8J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbdde9f6-e3c3-46c0-ab91-0ed5f7c19af3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"よだかのレコード「摩訶不思議なパーティからの脱出」\n\u003chttps://www.yodaka.info/event/2108genten\u003e\nなんか特別っぽくて公演数も少ないので、ソロ凸のつもりで1枚買ってみた。もし気になる人いたら、一緒に行きましょう(チケットは各位)。たぶんこれチケットもうすぐなくなると思います。","ts":"1625833772.048000","attachments":[{"fallback":"ドラマチックなリアル謎解きゲーム よだかのレコード: よだかのレコード9周記念公演　原点|よだかのレコード","id":1,"title":"よだかのレコード9周記念公演　原点|よだかのレコード","title_link":"https://www.yodaka.info/event/2108genten","text":"よだかのレコード9周記念公演　原点・摩訶不思議なパーティからの脱出","image_url":"https://www.yodaka.info/fw/public/images/event/2108genten/main.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"ドラマチックなリアル謎解きゲーム よだかのレコード","from_url":"https://www.yodaka.info/event/2108genten","original_url":"https://www.yodaka.info/event/2108genten"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Qh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30cfec4a-9c7e-47b5-a5b5-87718f1a4574","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"↑ジョジョ脱出 9/4(土) 12:20 で行きたい人いますか?","ts":"1625831454.046600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TPd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5eb01b5-129c-4519-ba4e-7cdec49d863a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"3部コラボをやった時は私はジョセフ役でした。「ハーミット・パープルッ」って言ってた","ts":"1625824160.046000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uOxKP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4c545ea-c685-4bcd-a27f-cd366123af91","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"ジョジョ立ちしないと出られない部屋…","ts":"1625824060.045100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vwdWx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5719ffc1-2640-444e-b5bb-cb9b674c9429","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"去年開催されてたけど緊急事態宣言で予定より早く終わってしまって結局行けなかったジョジョ脱出が再演。これは嬉しい\n\u003chttps://realdgame.jp/jojo5tour/\u003e","ts":"1625823635.044600","attachments":[{"fallback":"リアル脱出ゲーム×ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 黄金の風「ジョジョの奇妙な美術館からの脱出」 ジョジョ脱出","id":1,"title":"リアル脱出ゲーム×ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 黄金の風「ジョジョの奇妙な美術館からの脱出」 ジョジョ脱出","title_link":"https://realdgame.jp/jojo5tour/","text":"あなたが実際に「ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 黄金の風」の登場人物となり、謎に包まれた「美術館」からの脱出を目指す体験型ゲーム・イベント「ジョジョの奇妙な美術館からの脱出」公式サイトです。2021年8月5日～全国7都市で順次開催！","image_url":"https://realdgame.jp/jojo5tour/common/images/ogp.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"realdgame.jp","service_icon":"https://realdgame.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://realdgame.jp/jojo5tour/","original_url":"https://realdgame.jp/jojo5tour/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gp/fO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3635cb4-2b2f-4ba8-94c1-878ae74f881c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"スーパーペーパーキングダムからの脱出\n\u003chttps://realdgame.jp/paper_kingdom/\u003e\nこれ、4 人用ですけど別の場所での募集で 3 人集まってて、一応あと 1 人みたいな感じではあります。日程は決まってないけど公演自体が8月中頃まで。\nこっちで 4 人集まるならそういう手もある…?","ts":"1625810255.043700","attachments":[{"fallback":"【公式】スーパーペーパーキングダムからの脱出- リアル脱出ゲーム","id":1,"title":"【公式】スーパーペーパーキングダムからの脱出- リアル脱出ゲーム","title_link":"https://realdgame.jp/paper_kingdom/","text":"2021年6月より開催するリアル脱出ゲーム「スーパーペーパーキングダムからの脱出」特設サイトです。","image_url":"https://realdgame.jp/paper_kingdom/assets/img/ogp.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"realdgame.jp","service_icon":"https://realdgame.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://realdgame.jp/paper_kingdom/","original_url":"https://realdgame.jp/paper_kingdom/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=ZsP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a97efd75-9663-4a15-b4e8-34bd7091cde1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"緊急事態宣言も再突入しちゃうからなぁ","ts":"1625808223.041700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DtB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"835258e9-ea6c-4a2a-8c43-13f7de9b4561","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"了解です。別のを募集しようかな","ts":"1625808193.041400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yRDq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2af6298a-d526-4dfc-b4d1-ce69e117a8c4","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"今回は見送りましょう:cry:","ts":"1625805462.041000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yua"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a50cd42-dcc9-438a-91ac-811ac1739f1d","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"僕の方も厳しそうですわー。やっぱ時節柄厳しいですね","ts":"1625805450.040700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hzMyj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"847008ac-c55d-4c0f-b059-922335d45ff9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003c@UGXMRNBUM\u003e 人も集まらなさそう…さすがに諦めますかね…? (2人で行くと言う手も一応ありますがw)","ts":"1625804303.039900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"17j"}]}]
